<title>USA: Polyvision Corp says names Holt CEO.</title>
<headline>Polyvision Corp says names Holt CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PolyVision Corp said Thursday David Holt has been named chief executive officer of the Company, replacing Ivan Berkowitz. It is anticipated that Mr. Holt will be elected to the Board of Directors of PolyVision at its next meeting.</p>
<p>Prior to his appointment as PolyVision's CEO, Mr. Holt was a Group Vice President of Beloit Corporation, a unit of Harnischfeger Industries.</p>
<p>Berkowitz will continue as a member of PolyVision's Board of Directors.</p>
</text>
